OL,3,GNEWSAHigh Court challenge over 1,000
OL,4,Ahomes on green belt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign group and a council have
OL,7,Fchallenged the approval of nearly 1,000
OL,8,Fhomes on green belt land, in the High
OL,9,FCourt.
OL,11,FSENSE4CSP and Buckinghamshire Council
OL,12,Fhave sought to overturn the
OL,13,Fgovernment's decision to allow the
OL,14,FEpilepsy Society to sell land to a
OL,15,Fdeveloper for a housing in Chalfont St
OL,16,FPeter.
OL,18,FThe scheme would see up to 975 homes
OL,19,Fand other facilities built on the
OL,20,F300-acre (121-hectare) site off Chesham
OL,21,FLane.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
