OL,3,GNEWSAHigh Court challenge over 1,000
OL,4,Ahomes on green belt
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Epilepsy Society said it was
OL,7,Fdisappointed by the legal action,
OL,8,Fadding that it would further delay
OL,9,F"transformational" research and
OL,10,Fmuch-needed housing.
